	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5001,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5001:
	.ascii	"An RDF 1.2 quoted triple term has no OBO Graphs 0.3.2 term kind and is omitted from the view."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5001, 93

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5002,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5002,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5002:
	.ascii	"TypeScript uses structural object compatibility and index signatures apply to every string key, so it cannot constrain only JSON object properties not named by the schema. Named properties retain their exact declarations while the extra-property policy or value schema is widened."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5002, 280

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5003,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5003,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5003:
	.ascii	"JSON Schema contains/minContains/maxContains assertions quantify matching array elements and have no TypeScript assignability equivalent. Item and cardinality declarations remain while the contains predicate and match count are omitted."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5003, 236

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5004,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5004,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5004:
	.ascii	"JSON Schema if/then/else validates one branch according to runtime instance content; a general conditional relationship has no finite TypeScript declaration equivalent. Independently representable carrier constraints remain."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5004, 224

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5005,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5005,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5005:
	.ascii	"JSON Schema dependentRequired/dependentSchemas assertions impose cross-property runtime relationships that a general structural TypeScript declaration cannot enforce. Individual property declarations remain."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5005, 207

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5006,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5006,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5006:
	.ascii	"integer-validation-widened"
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5006, 26

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5007,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5007,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5007:
	.ascii	"TypeScript has one number type and cannot distinguish all JSON integers from fractional numbers. The generated declaration retains the number carrier while integer-only validation is widened."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5007, 191

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5008,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5008,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5008:
	.ascii	"A JSON Schema assertion outside the emitter's closed TypeScript 7.0 capability table has no sound declaration projection. The assertion is omitted and recorded at its schema location rather than disappearing silently."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5008, 217

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5009,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5009,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5009:
	.ascii	"General JSON Schema not is a set complement over instance validation. TypeScript's Exclude utility distributes over union members and cannot express that general complement, so the positive carrier remains while negation is omitted."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5009, 232

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5010,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5010,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5010:
	.ascii	"JSON Schema minimum/maximum/exclusive bounds and multipleOf over infinitely many numbers have no TypeScript expression: the only proper subtypes of number are unions of numeric literals, and TypeScript has no complement of a literal within number. (Over a finite const/enum the numbers that fail are left out, exactly.) Integer const/enum values outside the IEEE-754 safe range also have no exact TypeScript number literal. The numeric carrier or closest literal remains while the predicate or excess precision is omitted."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5010, 522

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5011,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5011,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5011:
	.ascii	"object-literal-validation-widened"
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5011, 33

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5012,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5012,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5012:
	.ascii	"A JSON Schema object-valued const or enum member requires exact key membership. TypeScript can preserve every named literal field but structural compatibility still accepts values with additional fields outside fresh-object checks."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5012, 231

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5013,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5013,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5013:
	.ascii	"A TypeScript union implements any-branch assignability and cannot generally enforce JSON Schema oneOf's exactly-one matching rule. Branch declarations remain as a union while overlap exclusivity is widened."
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5013, 206

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5014,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5014,"a",@progbits
