	.section	.rodata.str1.1,"aMS",@progbits,1
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5926:
	.asciz	"\025the skolem authority \300\016 is unusable: \300U; PurRDF mints no default authority, so the caller must supply an absolute IRI prefix"
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5926, 126

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5927,@object
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5927:
	.asciz	"\035the dataset already carries <\300!> under the supplied authority's \300Y space; skolemizing it would make the operation non-invertible, so the dataset is refused"
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5927, 157

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5928,@object
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5928:
	.asciz	"\017the genid IRI <\300Q> under the supplied authority does not decode under the skolem segment grammar (\300/); corrupt input is refused, not passed through"
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5928, 149

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5929,@object
	.section	.rodata..Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5929,"a",@progbits
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5929:
	.asciz	"\017the genid IRI <\300\200\310\000> under the supplied authority appears in a position that cannot hold a blank node (a predicate or a literal datatype); no skolemization can have produced it there, so the input is corrupt and refused"
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5929, 221

	.type	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5930,@object
	.section	.rodata.str1.1,"aMS",@progbits,1
.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5930:
	.asciz	"%deskolemizing would mint blank node (\300\b, scope \300r) which the dataset already carries; decoding would silently conflate two distinct nodes, so the operation refuses"
	.size	.Lanon.c57b04e44b95a713af94324763ba52bc.5930, 165

